{
  "id": "688",
  "title": "Wait Until You…",
  "level": "newbie",
  "date": "2019-03-21",
  "synopsis": "Little Ming’s mom wants new clothes to match her friends.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/997/ec04b270895926dce81132d60eb6ca0637332c8a.mp3?1552124448",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "等你……\n\n    一天，小明妈妈很不高兴地说：“我的朋友穿一千块的衣服，我穿一百块的衣服。我也想买贵的衣服。”\n    小明爸爸听后，说：“好，等你看好了我们就买。”\n    小明妈妈很高兴，问：“钱呢？”\n    小明爸爸想了想，说：“等你有钱了再买。”",
    "traditional": "等你……\n\n    一天，小明媽媽很不高興地說：“我的朋友穿一千塊的衣服，我穿一百塊的衣服。我也想買貴的衣服。”\n    小明爸爸聽後，說：“好，等你看好了我們就買。”\n    小明媽媽很高興，問：“錢呢？”\n    小明爸爸想了想，說：“等你有錢了再買。”"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Wait Until You…"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "一天，小明妈妈很不高兴地说：",
      "traditional": "一天，小明媽媽很不高興地說：",
      "pinyin": "yì tiān xiǎo míng mā ma hěn bù gāo xìng de shuō",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "“我的朋友穿一千块的衣服，我穿一百块的衣服。我也想买贵的衣服。”",
      "traditional": "“我的朋友穿一千塊的衣服，我穿一百塊的衣服。我也想買貴的衣服。”",
      "pinyin": "wǒ de péng you chuān yì qiān kuài de yī fu wǒ chuān yì bǎi kuài de yī fu wǒ yě xiǎng mǎi guì de yī fu",
      "english": "One day, Little Ming’s mom said saddened:"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "“My friends wear clothes for 1,000 yuan. I wear clothes for 100 yuan. I also want to buy expensive clothes.”"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "小明爸爸听后，说：“好，等你看好了我们就买。”",
      "traditional": "小明爸爸聽後，說：“好，等你看好了我們就買。”",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng bà ba tīng hòu shuō hǎo děng nǐ kàn hǎo le wǒ men jiù mǎi",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Upon hearing this, Little Ming’s dad said: “Ok. Let’s buy some after you’ve finished looking.”"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "小明妈妈很高兴，问：“钱呢？”",
      "traditional": "小明媽媽很高興，問：“錢呢？”",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng mā ma hěn gāo xìng wèn qián ne",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming’s mom got very happy and said: “What about the money?”"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "小明爸爸想了想，说：“等你有钱了再买。”",
      "traditional": "小明爸爸想了想，說：“等你有錢了再買。”",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng bà ba xiǎng le xiǎng shuō děng nǐ yǒu qián le zài mǎi",
      "english": ""
    }
  ],
